app/camera-sim/frames/ contains a curated, resized subset of the VisA dataset:

    VisA (Visual Anomaly)
    Amazon Science -- https://github.com/amazon-science/spot-diff
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Y. Zou, J. Jeong, L. Pemula, D. Zhang, O. Dabeer,
    "SPot-the-Difference Self-Supervised Pre-training for Anomaly Detection
    and Segmentation", ECCV 2022.

The frames carried here are 220 images from the pcb1 and capsules categories,
resized to fit 1280x720 and re-encoded as JPEG. They are otherwise unmodified.
The selection is reproducible with app/camera-sim/curate-visa.py; the full
dataset is not vendored. CC BY 4.0 permits this use, including commercially,
provided attribution is given -- which is the purpose of this notice.
